    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Legends of Myth</i> is a single-player RPG that blends prehistoric technology, mystical forces, and subtle touches of futurism into a unique, immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world filled with ancient ruins, strange machines, and powerful magic. Combat is slower-paced and deliberate, drawing inspiration from classic RPGs of the late '90s \u2014 where patience, preparation, and positioning matter more than reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover deep lore through exploration, dialogue, and environmental storytelling. Craft gear, gather rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast, handcrafted landscape. Whether you're wandering through forgotten temples or decoding remnants of ancient knowledge, <i>Legends of Myth</i> invites you to explore at your own pace and immerse yourself in a world unlike any other.<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliberate, Classic-Inspired Combat</strong> \u2013 Slower-paced battles that reward preparation and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Tech Meets Magic</strong> \u2013 A unique world where prehistoric tools, arcane powers, and futuristic remnants collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander freely and uncover hidden places, secrets, and mysteries.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Legends of Myth</i> is a single-player RPG that blends prehistoric technology, mystical forces, and subtle touches of futurism into a unique, immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world filled with ancient ruins, strange machines, and powerful magic. Combat is slower-paced and deliberate, drawing inspiration from classic RPGs of the late '90s \u2014 where patience, preparation, and positioning matter more than reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover deep lore through exploration, dialogue, and environmental storytelling. Craft gear, gather rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast, handcrafted landscape. Whether you're wandering through forgotten temples or decoding remnants of ancient knowledge, <i>Legends of Myth</i> invites you to explore at your own pace and immerse yourself in a world unlike any other.<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliberate, Classic-Inspired Combat</strong> \u2013 Slower-paced battles that reward preparation and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Tech Meets Magic</strong> \u2013 A unique world where prehistoric tools, arcane powers, and futuristic remnants collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander freely and uncover hidden places, secrets, and mysteries.</p></li></ul>",
